text = "[center]Programmers: Scooter-dev, Victfv
Art: Victfv
Music: Mishikis

Assets used:
Kenney prototyping textures - [url=https://www.kenney.nl][color=lightblue] www.kenney.nl [/color][/url]

CRT Shader by arlez80 - [url=https://godotshaders.com/shader/crt-shader-for-godot-engine-4/][color=lightblue]https://godotshaders.com/shader/crt-shader-for-godot-engine-4/[/color][/url]

Color reduction and dither shader by whiteshampoo - [url=https://godotshaders.com/shader/color-reduction-and-dither/][color=lightblue]https://godotshaders.com/shader/color-reduction-and-dither/[/color][/url]

3D glitch shader by flametime - [url=https://godotshaders.com/shader/3d-glitch/][color=lightblue]https://godotshaders.com/shader/3d-glitch/[/color][/url]

HSV adjustment shader by al1-ce - [url=https://godotshaders.com/shader/hsv-adjustment/][color=lightblue]https://godotshaders.com/shader/hsv-adjustment/[/color][/url]

Font: PC senior - [url=https://www.1001fonts.com/pc-senior-font.html][color=lightblue]https://www.1001fonts.com/pc-senior-font.html[/color][/url]

CC0 sounds from [url=https://freesound.org/][color=lightblue]https://freesound.org/[/color][/url]

[center]"
